index b158c2b..08ceb62 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+- `--json` output gives `unit` as an object with the unit's `symbol` and singular `name`.
 - Fixed: unit symbols in quantities were matched without regard to case, so `3 Mm` was read as millimetres. Symbols now match exactly; a symbol that matches only when case is ignored is refused with the spellings it might mean.
 - `convert()` returns the exact converted value and no longer takes `precision` or `rounding`; `format_quantity()` takes them instead, so chained conversions no longer drift.
 - `unitconv dimensions` lists the named dimensions and their formulas.
